  "title": "Slow Pork Ragu",
  "subtitle": "Italian-style pulled pork in a rich tomato and wine sauce",
  "excerpt": "This ragu starts with pork shoulder braised low and slow in a base of soffritto, tomatoes, and a little red wine vinegar until the meat shreds into the sauce. It clings well to wide pasta shapes like pappardelle or rigatoni. The flavour deepens significantly overnight.",
