        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Cook the soffritto of onion, carrot, and celery slowly until very soft and lightly golden before adding the pork. A well-cooked soffritto is the backbone of the finished ragu." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "What you need" }]
